The Digital UNIX aka Tru64 UNIX V4.0x code does not (an will never) support
multi-bus failover, because the device naming is based upon the devices
physical
position (bus/target/lun).
To use multibus failover, you need to upgrade to V5.xy, that implements the
new
device naming sceme based on WWID. (world-wide-id)

Rgds,
     Johan.




