Hi Carl,

Defining the rcmgr CPQHEOSCOMMONPOLLFREQ variable should not be
confused with using snmp_request to set the cpqHeOsCommonPollFreq MIB
attribute in the Compaq Health MIB.  (You cannot set/write to
cpqHeOsCommonPollFreq.)  The rcmgr value is examined by the cpq_mibs
daemon at start-up to see if polling should be activated and at what
rate.  I can see where this would be confusing and will suggest that
the documentation be updated accordingly.

Thanks,
Lynda


