There is a command line utility in Tru64Unix V5.1; lprsetup..

You can use it to make new printers with the Operating system
redirection property..

You can make a printer and save the screens with ;
lprsetup | tee MyBunchee

Study the MyBunchee file .. using only the printer properties info,
you have fed, you can make a file of printers..say MyPrinters

lprsetup < MyPrinters should give the required result..


