9-pin DIN & connector with three large barrels a la 13W3 (but is NOT a
13W3.. just had three large barrels).

1 - video cable for said card; p/n 1702906? F end of tri-barrel connection
above on one end, BNC R/G/B connections on the other end. This will probably
go with the video card. Tri-barrel connector end of cable has sheath pulling
away from connection jack; don't know about the health of the internal
wiring but it did work last time it was used (spring).

2 - memory modules. each module consists of 1 riser card (50-21814)
populated with four SIMM-type memory sticks (5021138-01, individual ram
chips on sticks are "TI - 70 / TMS44400DJ / OBI 4272 BV"; 10 chips to a
stick).

