passwd is the correct command to change the user's password
with Enhanced Security enabled.  The first thing I'd check is
to make sure you have :+ at the end of the /etc/passwd file
and both auth=local,yp and passwd=local,yp in the
/etc/svc.conf file.  Also, you might want to make sure that
you're properly distributing the prpasswd map.


